{"title":"Scroll Thunderstorm","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Gaunt Ogre, Virikh Templar, Redrock Troll, Ogre Mauler, Ogre Butcher</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      <p><b>Teaches</b> Thunderstorm, a level-4 Shock spell. Needs 40 Intellect and Shock skill 25 to learn and to cast.</p><p><b>Drops from monsters that cast Shock spells, level 30+.</b></p><ul class=\"wp-list\">\n          <li>A monster that casts spells drops scrolls of its own school, so look for Shock casters.</li>\n          <li>The monster’s level picks the spell level: <b>8+</b> drops level-2 scrolls, <b>18+</b> level-3 and <b>30+</b> level-4.</li>\n          </ul>\n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"redrock-troll\" title=\"Redrock Troll - dropped it in 1 of 11 looted corpses (1/11)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/35eba38141cb18301655.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Redrock Troll</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/11<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"virikh-templar\" title=\"Virikh Templar - dropped it in 1 of 188 looted corpses (1/188)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7c6325d168ea4e24bc71.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Virikh Templar</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/188<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-gaunt\" title=\"Gaunt Ogre - dropped it in 4 of 854 looted corpses (1/214)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/97882a8de7cbdb0222cc.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gaunt Ogre</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/214<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-mauler\" title=\"Ogre Mauler - dropped it in 1 of 567 looted corpses (1/567)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/75903b759d1521edd876.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Mauler</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/567<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+1 more\">+1 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-butcher\" title=\"Ogre Butcher - dropped it in 1 of 945 looted corpses (1/945)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/2cf1b40edc5c1e611ef5.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Butcher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/945<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"scroll-thunderstorm\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/aa809f8f0fc1d5bded11.svg\" alt=\"Scroll Thunderstorm\"></div><h3>Scroll Thunderstorm</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>5 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/27/2026, 9:37:12 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}